        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Reguitti SDK091PA Contemporary Round Pocket Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFrom <a href=\"/collections/ahi-sliding-door-hardware\"><b>AHI Sliding Door Hardware</b></a> collection, the new round sliding pocket door passage set that offers both fashion and high quality function. Packaged as a complete pocket door pull set that includes two (2) round flush pulls and a round edge pull. Made in Italy by Reguitti.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 4 high quality finishes and fit both <b>1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" thick pocket doors</b>. The flush pulls have a very low 1/16\" projection off the surface of the door, so they are suitable for use on tight pocket doors (sliding door with minimal clearance with its wall pocket).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe edge pull is pressure mounted into the doors edge. The round flush pulls are pressure mounted into the doors face - no screws, very clean appearance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-round-pocket-lock-privacy-reguitti-sdk091pv\"><b>Contemporary Round Pocket Door Lock</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/double-pocket-door-lock-set-reguitti-sdk091pv-pa\"><b>Contemporary Round Double Pocket Door Lock Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SDK091PA Contemporary Round Pocket Door Passage Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Diameter: 1-7/8\" (48 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/contemporary-round-fingertip-edge-pull-ahi-ep1272\">Round Edge Pull</a> Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDK091PA.pdf?v=1691093347\" target=\"new\"><b>SDK091PA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls and a  edge pull. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
